ый пирог. Посетители хвалят.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Йошкар-Ола"},{"id":"yoshkar_ola_wv_kalyannaya_marrakesh","areaId":"yoshkar_ola","name":"Кальянная «Марракеш»","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":56.63483,"lng":47.8963},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"yoshkar_ola_wv_kalyannaya_marrakesh","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["кальяннаямарракеш","yoshkarola"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Много восточной символики и, конечно, много кальянов — говорят, что некурящим может быть не очень комфортно. Из еды какие-то закуски.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Йошкар-Ола"},{"id":"yoshkar_ola_wv_restoran_kamelot","areaId":"yoshkar_ola","name":"Ресторан «Камелот»","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":56.63706,"lng":47.88362},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"yoshkar_ola_wv_restoran_kamelot","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["ресторанкамелот","yoshkarola"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Ресторан, в котором нашлось место кулинарным изыскам типа фуа-гра и морепродуктов. Хорошие отзывы.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Йошкар-Ола"},{"id":"yoshkar_ola_wv_sushi_bar_yin_yang","areaId":"yoshkar_ola","name":"Sushi bar Yin Yang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":56.6369,"lng":47.8859},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"yoshkar_ola_wv_sushi_bar_yin_yang","tickets":[{"vendor":"Officia